 Задание 3. Размеры таблиц и индексов

 3.1. Подготовка данных

```sql
data_lowlevel@student= CREATE TABLE t2(
    id integer GENERATED ALWAYS AS IDENTITY PRIMARY KEY,
    n numeric
);
CREATE TABLE

data_lowlevel@student= INSERT INTO t2(n) SELECT id FROM generate_series(1, 10_000) AS id;
INSERT 0 10000

data_lowlevel@student= VACUUM t2;
VACUUM
```

 3.2. Проверка путей к файлам

```sql
data_lowlevel@student= SELECT pg_relation_filepath('t2');

 pg_relation_filepath 
----------------------
 base/16386/16393
(1 row)

data_lowlevel@student= SELECT pg_relation_filepath('t2_pkey');

 pg_relation_filepath 
----------------------
 base/16386/16398
(1 row)
```

 3.3. Просмотр файлов основного слоя и fsm

```bash
student$ sudo -u postgres ls -l /var/lib/postgresql/16/main/base/16386/16393

-rw------- 1 postgres postgres 450560 ноя 15 13:20 .../16393
-rw------- 1 postgres postgres  24576 ноя 15 13:20 .../16393_fsm
-rw------- 1 postgres postgres   8192 ноя 15 13:20 .../16393_vm

student$ sudo -u postgres ls -l /var/lib/postgresql/16/main/base/16386/16398

